BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Graham] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200225T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200225T220000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-397@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Between 5am February 25 and 9pm February 27 (2 days)\, we will
  be upgrading the storage infrastructure behind /project and conducting ma
 intenance work on the datacenter’s electrical system.\nAll services prov
 ided by the Graham compute cluster will be unavailable during this outage\
 , including job scheduling\, access to login nodes\, access to storage (in
 cluding via Globus and the DTN) and the access to VDI nodes\, but the main
 tenance will not affect the Graham Cloud. The scheduler will avoid startin
 g jobs that would extend into the outage. Any jobs running at the time of 
 the outage will be killed.\n---\nEntre 5h (HE) le 25 février et 21h (HE) 
 le 27 février\, nous effectuerons une mise à jour de l’infrastructure 
 de stockage derrière /project ainsi que des travaux de maintenance au sys
 tème d’alimentation électrique du centre de données.\nLes services de
  la grappe de calcul ne seront pas disponibles\, y compris l’ordonnancem
 ent des tâches et l’accès aux nœuds de connexion\, au stockage (inclu
 ant via Globus et le DTN) et aux nœuds VDI. Le service Graham cloud ne se
 ra pas affecté. L’ordonnanceur retiendra les tâches dont l’exécutio
 n est prévue à l’intérieur de la période d’arrêt de service\, mai
 s les tâches en cours d'exécution seront supprimées.\n\nhttps://status.
 alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=397
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=397
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Scheduled Cedar Upgrade and Expansion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200316T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200323T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-402@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:The Cedar system will be unavailable during March 16-22\, 2020
  due to a major system expansion and upgrade.\nDuring this week-long downt
 ime\, the Cedar team will be adding 768 compute nodes (36864 cores) and 19
 2 GPU nodes (768 GPU cards)\, as well as:\n- upgrading BIOS and firmware o
 f compute nodes and network switches\, - upgrading the operating system\, 
 - upgrading the file system software and storage controller firmware\, - u
 pgrading the network drivers\, - modifying the scheduling software\, - ben
 chmarking the new system.\nCedar will be unavailable starting at 6am (Paci
 fic time) on March 16 and is expected to be available again on March 23. T
 his site will receive updates during the downtime in case the status chang
 es.\nAll jobs that are still running at the start of the downtime will be 
 terminated and need to be resubmitted once the system is back online.\n\nh
 ttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=402
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=402
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200316T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200316T100000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-410@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:(Version française au bas de la page) Graham Cloud will be un
 available from 9 am (Eastern)\, March 16\, 2020\, to 9 am (Eastern)\, Marc
 h 18\, 2020\, due to scheduled maintenance. During this period\, the cloud
  portal will be unreachable.\nRunning VMs will be shut down and restarted 
 after the outage\; we recommend that your VMs be shut down gracefully befo
 re the downtime to avoid data corruption.If you have any questions about t
 his outage\, please contact [email protected] .\n****\nEn raison de trava
 ux prévus\, le nuage Graham ne sera pas disponible à compter de 9h (HAE)
  le 16 mars jusqu’à 9h (HAE) le 18 mars 2020.\nAu cours de cette pério
 de\, aucun accès au portail ne sera possible. Les instances en cours au m
 oment de l’arrêt de service seront éteintes et reprises à la fin de l
 a maintenance\; nous vous recommandons de fermer correctement vos instance
 s pour éviter la corruption de vos données.\nNous vous remercions de vot
 re compréhension.\nSi vous avez des questions\, écrivez à [email prote
 cted] .\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=410
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=410
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Niagara] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200325T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200325T080000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-409@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:All resources at SciNet will undergo a two-day maintenance shu
 tdown on March 25th and 26th 2020\, starting at 7 am EDT on Wednesday Marc
 h 25th. There will be no access to any of the SciNet systems (Niagara\, Mi
 st\, HPSS\, Teach cluster\, or the file systems) during this time.\nThis s
 hutdown is necessary to finish the expansion of the Niagara cluster and it
 s storage system.\nWe expect to be able to bring the systems back online t
 he evening of March 26th. For up-to-date and more detailed information on 
 the status of all the SciNet systems\, you can always check https://docs.s
 cinet.utoronto.ca.\nSome aspects of the maintenance took longer than expec
 ted. The systems will not be back up until some time tomorrow\, Friday Mar
 ch 27\, 2020.\n---\nToutes les ressources de calcul et de stockage située
 s dans le centre de données de SciNet (Niagara\, Mist\, HPSS\, Teach\, et
  les systèmes de fichiers de stockage) ne seront pas disponibles les 25 e
 t 26 mars 2020\, à partir de 7h (heure de l'Est) le mercredi 25 mars.\nL
 ’arrêt de service est nécessaire pour compléter l'expansion de Niagar
 a et son système de stockage.\nNous espérons pouvoir remettre les systè
 mes en ligne le 26 mars en soir. Les mises à jour détailées seront post
 ées sur https://docs.scinet.utoronto.ca Certains aspects de l'entretien o
 nt pris plus de temps que prévu. Les systèmes ne seront pas disponibles 
 avant demain\, vendredi 27 mars 2020.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/vie
 w_incident?incident=409
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=409
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
