DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200422T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200423T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-425@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Maintenance will be performed on Graham's cooling system betwe
 en 7 and 11AM on Wednesday\, April 22. During and leading up to this time\
 , the cluster will avoid starting jobs\, but running jobs will continue. Y
 ou will be able to login\, access files and submit jobs\, but jobs won't s
 tart until after the maintenance.\nMaintenance was completed successfully.
 \n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=425
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=425
END:VEVENT
