BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] CANARIE/BCNET Backbone Network Maintenance in Victoria I
 mpacts Arbutus Access on July 18\, 2020 06:00-12:00 PT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20200718T060000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20200718T120000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-464@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Upstream network maintenance will impact access to the Arbutus
  cloud on July 18 between 06:00 - 12:00 PT. Access to Arbutus from Researc
 h and peering networks will be impacted for a 2 hour period during this ma
 intenance window. Access to Arbutus from Internet transit services (non-pe
 ering and non-research) will continue to work during this maintenance. Bel
 ow is the notification from BCNET/CANARIE:\nFrom: 06:00 PT Saturday\, July
  18\, 2020 To: 12:00 PT Saturday\, July 18\, 2020 Reason: CANARIE will per
 form maintenance work on the WROADM network optical domains in preparation
  for network equipment upgrades later this year.\nEffects: Backbone networ
 k connectivity between Seattle and Victoria\, Victoria and Vancouver\, and
  Vancouver and Kamloops will be under maintenance during this window.\nFor
  all Vancouver Island members\, all NREN/ORAN connectivity and Peering ser
 vices at the BCNET Victoria Exchange\, VICTX\, will be impacted. The expec
 ted service interruption is up to 2 hours at the beginning of the maintena
 nce window. The Internet Transit services at VICTX will not be impacted an
 d will stay operational throughout the maintenance window.\n\nhttps://stat
 us.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=464
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=464
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Graham] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200724T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200725T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-467@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Graham will be unavailable on 07/24/2020 10:00 AM for up to 3 
 hours. Only pending jobs with a requested time limit less than this date w
 ill start. During this time\, only compute nodes will be down\, so you WIL
 L be able to log in to the cluster and access storage\, but jobs will not 
 be running. Any jobs that are running at the time of the outage will be te
 rminated and you will need to re-submit them once the cluster is back onli
 ne.\n/ Graham ne sera pas disponible le 2020-07-24 à compter de 10h HAE p
 our une durée d’environ 3 heures. Les nœuds de calcul ne seront pas di
