DESCRIPTION:On Wednesday December 8\, 2021\, at 2:30 PM ET\, maintenance w
 ork on the firewall at the SciNet datacenter will be performed. Datacenter
  external connections will be interrupted for approximately 30 minutes.\nD
 uring this period\, there will be no access to Niagara\, Mist\, Rouge\, HP
 SS\, or the Teach cluster. Jobs in the queue will continue to run\, and ac
 cess should return by 3:00 PM EST.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_i
 ncident?incident=683
