BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20240604T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20240605T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1124@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Fibre work completed at 22:20 PDT On June 4\, 2024\, Cedar Com
 pute\, Cedar Cloud\, and associated services will be undergoing system upg
 rades.\nPlease note that on June 4th from 11:30 to 19:30 PDT\, there will 
 be network fibre work being carried out\, resulting in the unavailability 
 of all Cedar services and network connectivity during this period.\nFollow
 ing the restoration of network connectivity\, Cedar Cloud will come back o
 nline\, but Cedar Compute will remain offline until June 8 as we upgrade t
 he cluster operating system\, various storage systems\, and user-visible s
 ervices from CentOS 7 to AlmaLinux 9. This upgrade is in anticipation of t
 he End of Life of the CentOS 7 operating system at the end of June\, 2024.
 \nIf you have any questions or concerns about this please contact [email 
 protected] .\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1124
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1124
END:VEVENT
