DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240605T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1122@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:On June 4\, 2024\, Cedar Compute\, Cedar Cloud\, and associate
 d services will be undergoing system upgrades.\nPlease note that on June 4
 th from 11:30 to 19:30 PDT\, there will be network fibre work being carrie
 d out\, resulting in the unavailability of all Cedar services and network 
 connectivity during this period.\nFollowing the restoration of network con
 nectivity\, Cedar Cloud will come back online\, but Cedar Compute will rem
 ain offline until June 8 as we upgrade the cluster operating system\, vari
 ous storage systems\, and user-visible services from CentOS 7 to AlmaLinux
  9. This upgrade is in anticipation of the End of Life of the CentOS 7 ope
 rating system at the end of June\, 2024.\nIf you have any questions or con
 cerns about this please contact [email protected] .\n\nhttps://status.all
 iancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1122
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1122
