BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] Scheduled Maintenance Possible Outage: Arbutus - Network
  Switch Updates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240605T063000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240605T073000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1128@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:On June 5th 2024\, starting at 06:30AM Pacific time\, network 
 switches contributing to the Arbutus Cloud's infrastructure will receive f
 irmware updates. These updates will require restarting the switches\, prod
 ucing brief periods of unavailability for connected systems.\nMost Arbutus
  Cloud infrastructure is configured redundantly at either the control plan
 e or network fabric layers\, but the switches affected by this set of upda
 tes will affect all compute nodes\, and as a result there will be a disrup
 tion of network traffic to all user VM instances \, expected to last up to
  30 minutes.\nThere may also be a period of degraded API performance as th
 e cloud infrastructure re-balances after the updates.\n\nhttps://status.al
 liancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1128
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1128
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Nextcloud] Scheduled Maintenance for Nextcloud Services
