DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1629@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:As part of the installation of the AI expansion for the Trill
 ium cluster\, t he next maintenance window is scheduled for June 9-10\, be
 ginning at 4:00 AM EDT.\nDuring this period\, most systems located in the 
 SciNet datacentre will be down.  This includes HPSS\, Open OnDemand\, S4H
 \, Balam\, Teach\, Neptune\, Killarney and the other Vector Institute syst
 ems.  The Trillium login nodes and storage will remain up and available.
   The Trillium and Trillium-GPU compute nodes will be down initially\, an
 d we will power them up gradually as cooling permits.\n\nhttps://status.al
 liancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1629
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1629
END:VEVENT
